	"name": "Guerilla Leader",
	"type": "feature",
	"img": "icons/skills/social/diplomacy-unity-alliance.webp",
	"system": {
		"description": "<p>Also at 3rd level, you are able to command others to action. As a bonus action, you may give a swift command to a creature who can see or hear you within 10ft. As a reaction to receiving the command, the creature may take a specific action so long as your share a language. The commands are as follows:</p><ul><li><p><strong>Fade:</strong> The target can immediately attempt to hide so long as they have cover or concealment.</p></li><li><p><strong>Fight:</strong> The target may immediately make a melee attack on a creature within reach.</p></li><li><p><strong>Flee:</strong> The target may move up to 15ft without provoking opportunity attacks.</p></li></ul>",
